## Interface: 120100
## Title: Coby's Linkepedia
## Version: 2.0.0
## Author: Cobanyte
## Notes: Your personal item encyclopedia. Search, autocomplete and link any item in the game from a database the addon builds on your own client, with no addon update needed after a patch.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Book_09
## SavedVariables: COBYS_LINKEPEDIA_DB, COBYS_LINKEPEDIA_CONFIG, COBYS_LINKEPEDIA_STATE, COBYS_LINKEPEDIA_WINDOW_STATE, COBYS_LINKEPEDIA_DEBUG_LOG
## AddonCompartmentFunc: CobysLinkepedia_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: CobysLinkepedia_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: CobysLinkepedia_OnAddonCompartmentLeave

